  "denominator_note": "Eleven PS2_PM6 targets drawn from the four Stage-0 sources whose DOI is recorded in the frozen fact table (rett_006 five events, rett_007 four events, rett_011 one event, rett_084 one event). Each arm sends a uniform query ladder generated from (gene, variant HGVS, disease): a recall-oriented form and a specific form per language. The ladder is required because PubMed ANDs every term, so a single over-specified query returns nothing and would measure query luck instead of reachability. No query is tuned against a gold record's title. Queries are model-proposed pre-registration content pending protocol confirmation and are frozen so a probe does not depend on a runtime query translator. rett_006 additionally carries PubMed PMID 24750837 (Zhongguo Dang Dai Er Ke Za Zhi 2014), whose esummary record has no DOI; identifier matching therefore accepts DOI or PMID.",
  "english_source_adjudication": "pending",
